WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:39.082
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:39.352 --> 00:43.064
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

3
00:43.147 --> 00:45.775
‎THIS DRAMA IS FICTITIOUS AND DIFFERS FROM ‎ACTUAL MEDICAL PRACTICES AND REGULATIONS.

4
00:45.859 --> 00:48.069
‎CHARACTERS AND SETTINGS ARE FICTIONAL. ‎CHILD ACTORS WERE FILMED SAFELY.

5
00:57.412 --> 01:00.957
‎Does Baraka appear in your dreams?

6
01:02.375 --> 01:03.585
‎No matter how long I wait…

7
01:05.545 --> 01:07.672
‎Baraka doesn't appear in my dreams.

8
01:09.507 --> 01:10.592
‎That makes all dreams

9
01:11.593 --> 01:13.094
‎excruciating for me.

10
01:22.020 --> 01:25.356
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

11
01:28.484 --> 01:30.987
‎FINALE

12
01:56.971 --> 01:57.805
‎You're finally awake.

13
02:00.266 --> 02:02.060
‎I had something to ask before the surgery.

14
02:03.228 --> 02:04.604
‎But for you to answer…

15
02:11.819 --> 02:13.071
‎this will need to come off.

16
02:14.322 --> 02:17.158
‎He couldn't smother you with it on.

17
02:17.825 --> 02:19.369
‎He's a doctor. He should've known.

18
02:20.912 --> 02:21.746
‎SYSTEM SHUTTING DOWN

19
02:22.705 --> 02:24.207
‎He should've turned off the monitor,

20
02:25.166 --> 02:26.292
‎then removed the mask.

21
02:26.876 --> 02:28.086
‎What an idiot.

22
02:29.587 --> 02:31.589
‎He's just not that kind of person.

23
02:33.508 --> 02:36.344
‎He isn't the type to set his mind

24
02:37.428 --> 02:38.429
‎on deep, genuine revenge

25
02:39.597 --> 02:43.184
‎against someone who hurt him,

26
02:44.686 --> 02:46.020
‎meticulously plan it out,

27
02:47.188 --> 02:49.148
‎and follow through with it.

28
02:53.569 --> 02:55.196
‎That's not who he is.

29
02:56.781 --> 03:00.034
‎All he could do was hold a cushion down ‎on the monster before him.

30
03:03.329 --> 03:04.622
‎Because…

31
03:05.581 --> 03:07.500
‎he's just a good, innocent person.

32
03:10.211 --> 03:11.045
‎But…

33
03:17.010 --> 03:18.094
‎that's not the case for me.

34
03:31.149 --> 03:32.900
‎Beginning dissection. Bovie.

35
03:36.821 --> 03:41.576
‎FLUMAZENIL: A REVERSAL AGENT USED ‎TO WAKE A PATIENT FROM CERTAIN SEDATIVES

36
03:44.162 --> 03:46.622
‎Why can't I go into the OR?

37
03:48.833 --> 03:51.544
‎Why do I have to stay with the donor?

38
03:56.007 --> 03:57.050
‎I want to go in.

39
04:00.428 --> 04:02.472
‎I can't let you two do this alone.

40
04:02.972 --> 04:04.098
‎Do you have to do this?

41
04:04.974 --> 04:06.225
‎Do you really have to…

42
04:07.977 --> 04:09.729
‎insist on not letting us go?

43
04:10.855 --> 04:11.731
‎Yes.

44
04:12.440 --> 04:13.441
‎I won't let go.

45
04:14.942 --> 04:17.528
‎Not when I know ‎you two won't let go either.

46
04:24.285 --> 04:26.162
‎You're done being a doctor after this!

47
04:30.458 --> 04:31.501
‎You both think

48
04:32.627 --> 04:34.879
‎this will be your last surgery.

49
04:36.506 --> 04:39.425
‎We don't even know ‎how many others suffered besides me.

50
04:40.051 --> 04:41.636
‎But you know we can't stop him,

51
04:41.719 --> 04:43.805
‎so you're going in there, ‎risking everything.

52
04:46.224 --> 04:47.558
‎I can't take it.

53
04:50.228 --> 04:51.312
‎I'll risk it all too.

54
04:53.523 --> 04:55.108
‎Let me go with you.

55
05:03.950 --> 05:06.202
‎My dream is to be a doctor.

56
05:06.702 --> 05:09.288
‎Being like you is my dream.

57
05:09.872 --> 05:11.582
‎I want to become a doctor.

58
05:23.511 --> 05:24.720
‎Your hands…

59
05:26.764 --> 05:27.932
‎belong in medicine.

60
05:28.683 --> 05:29.517
‎Your hands…

61
05:31.561 --> 05:33.187
‎should save lives.

62
05:39.235 --> 05:40.236
‎This is just

63
05:41.237 --> 05:42.238
‎a foolish prayer

64
05:43.531 --> 05:45.158
‎for those of us…

65
05:48.953 --> 05:50.371
‎who failed to hold onto others.

66
05:52.331 --> 05:54.292
‎It's for desperate people like us

67
05:55.835 --> 05:56.961
‎who have no other way…

68
05:59.755 --> 06:00.840
‎to find peace.

69
06:21.611 --> 06:23.362
‎I was going over the timeline…

70
06:24.572 --> 06:25.531
‎I mean…

71
06:26.616 --> 06:28.451
‎I went over the order of events.

72
06:31.162 --> 06:34.624
‎If I had found out about it sooner…

73
06:36.125 --> 06:37.251
‎That is…

74
06:38.044 --> 06:39.086
‎Maybe you…

75
06:42.006 --> 06:45.635
‎Maybe I could have…

76
06:47.720 --> 06:48.721
‎stopped it…

77
06:53.267 --> 06:55.019
‎I shouldn't be saying this to you.

78
06:55.728 --> 06:58.648
‎I should be asking myself, pushing myself,

79
06:59.815 --> 07:01.525
‎and punishing myself with these words.

80
07:03.694 --> 07:04.528
‎Dr. Jo.

81
07:05.112 --> 07:07.073
‎Let me help, okay?

82
07:07.156 --> 07:08.658
‎I'll do anything.

83
07:08.741 --> 07:10.409
‎I'll do whatever you want.

84
07:12.787 --> 07:13.996
‎Then let us do it.

85
07:15.206 --> 07:18.000
‎Let us handle it, just the two of us.

86
07:18.876 --> 07:20.545
‎So that we can keep you safe.

87
07:23.422 --> 07:24.840
‎So that after all this passes…

88
07:29.053 --> 07:30.721
‎at least you won't disappear.

89
07:38.604 --> 07:39.772
‎Let us do that.

90
07:44.694 --> 07:45.528
‎Just let…

91
07:47.572 --> 07:48.990
‎Just let the two of us do it.

92
08:19.228 --> 08:21.105
‎Somehow we both survived

93
08:21.772 --> 08:23.899
‎and made it all the way here.

94
08:35.703 --> 08:37.246
‎Those shoes…

95
08:38.706 --> 08:40.249
‎I had them buried…

96
08:42.084 --> 08:44.253
‎with Baraka in his grave.

97
08:46.881 --> 08:48.758
‎That's when I heard it.

98
08:50.343 --> 08:52.928
‎God forgave me.

99
08:54.722 --> 08:56.766
‎The children's letters…

100
08:58.768 --> 09:01.479
‎Look at the children's letters.

101
09:03.397 --> 09:04.482
‎The children…

102
09:05.858 --> 09:07.902
‎love me.

103
09:32.134 --> 09:33.094
‎Why?

104
09:34.387 --> 09:35.554
‎Why did you choose me?

105
09:36.514 --> 09:37.598
‎Because…

106
09:39.058 --> 09:41.852
‎no matter who the patient is…

107
09:43.771 --> 09:45.898
‎you always save them.

108
09:48.025 --> 09:50.778
‎My most brilliant student,

109
09:51.904 --> 09:55.199
‎the one who resembles me the most…

110
09:56.242 --> 09:59.412
‎and never fails.

111
10:00.955 --> 10:01.831
‎That's you.

112
10:03.249 --> 10:04.291
‎Gye Su-jeong.

113
10:10.089 --> 10:10.965
‎Good.

114
10:13.342 --> 10:15.094
‎That's what I wanted to hear.

115
10:54.717 --> 10:56.093
‎Don't do it, Su-jeong!

116
10:56.677 --> 10:57.887
‎Su-jeong.

117
11:24.330 --> 11:25.164
‎It's Neema.

118
11:35.633 --> 11:36.509
‎Hello.

119
11:36.592 --> 11:37.885
‎Hello.

120
11:42.765 --> 11:43.807
‎Maeum.

121
11:44.475 --> 11:46.435
‎And this is heart.

122
11:46.977 --> 11:48.395
‎"Maeum."

123
12:07.665 --> 12:09.625
‎She still can't speak yet.

124
12:10.417 --> 12:11.293
‎Not yet.

125
12:12.586 --> 12:14.964
‎But she worked really hard

126
12:15.673 --> 12:17.925
‎practicing how to say "hello" to you.

127
12:19.802 --> 12:21.011
‎Isn't that amazing?

128
12:22.221 --> 12:23.597
‎You even know how to spell

129
12:23.681 --> 12:25.516
‎Su-jeong's name in Korean now, right?

130
12:29.186 --> 12:30.145
‎Isn't she incredible?

131
12:31.313 --> 12:33.440
‎Look how much Neema has grown.

132
12:34.817 --> 12:35.818
‎I brought her here.

133
12:36.944 --> 12:38.362
‎I asked her to come.

134
12:40.030 --> 12:41.031
‎To hold you back.

135
12:42.866 --> 12:43.701
‎So that…

136
12:45.286 --> 12:46.745
‎you could finally stop.

137
13:29.747 --> 13:32.207
‎Nice to see you again, Dr. Jang.

138
13:33.042 --> 13:35.419
‎Now, please hand over Neema.

139
13:35.502 --> 13:36.795
‎What?

140
13:36.879 --> 13:39.131
‎You kidnapped Neema and hid her from us.

141
13:39.214 --> 13:41.175
‎You can't do that. She's one of ours.

142
13:41.258 --> 13:42.468
‎We searched everywhere for her.

143
13:43.052 --> 13:44.511
‎Of course, you did. She's a witness.

144
13:45.471 --> 13:48.015
‎She's the only one who knows ‎you stole the photos,

145
13:48.098 --> 13:50.851
‎buried the truth, ‎and pinned it all on Su-jeong.

146
13:52.519 --> 13:53.562
‎That's nonsense.

147
13:53.646 --> 13:54.688
‎You bastards.

148
13:55.356 --> 13:58.067
‎I know exactly ‎what kind of people you are!

149
13:58.567 --> 13:59.443
‎Dr. Jang.

150
14:00.027 --> 14:03.197
‎We can't let a few broken trees ‎ruin Baba's entire forest.

151
14:05.157 --> 14:07.618
‎Neema, how have you been?

152
14:08.202 --> 14:10.871
‎You've been afraid, haven't you?

153
14:11.997 --> 14:14.166
‎Let's go home now.

154
14:15.084 --> 14:16.293
‎-Ms. Jang! ‎-Young doctor.

155
14:20.172 --> 14:21.173
‎I'm stopping…

156
14:24.176 --> 14:25.052
‎the surgery.

157
14:26.095 --> 14:27.846
‎Then Baba will die.

158
14:28.764 --> 14:30.391
‎If you touch Neema…

159
14:35.020 --> 14:36.563
‎I won't do a thing.

160
14:37.564 --> 14:40.067
‎I may be Baba's favorite student,

161
14:40.150 --> 14:44.613
‎but I don't consider him my mentor.

162
14:45.656 --> 14:46.490
‎Take her.

163
14:48.117 --> 14:48.951
‎No.

164
14:52.246 --> 14:53.747
‎Here you are.

165
14:54.498 --> 14:56.500
‎The donor surgery wrapped up,

166
14:56.583 --> 14:59.545
‎so I came looking for ‎the White Wings Medical Corps staff

167
14:59.628 --> 15:02.548
‎to invite you to my office.

168
15:03.590 --> 15:06.051
‎Well, we need to stay--

169
15:06.135 --> 15:09.346
‎It's rather cramped and stuffy in here.

170
15:09.430 --> 15:11.348
‎The surgery will go well.

171
15:11.932 --> 15:13.225
‎Come with me.

172
15:36.623 --> 15:37.624
‎Director Bu.

173
15:37.708 --> 15:40.335
‎I can't explain right now, but…

174
15:40.961 --> 15:42.629
‎I need your help.

175
15:42.713 --> 15:44.339
‎I'll explain everything later.

176
16:31.095 --> 16:32.054
‎TURN OFF AFTER USE

177
16:33.680 --> 16:35.516
‎Why isn't this working?

178
17:35.200 --> 17:39.037
‎YOU ‎GUY SU-JEONG

179
17:43.292 --> 17:45.878
‎GUY SU-JEONG

180
19:12.089 --> 19:14.758
‎Let's continue.

181
19:37.322 --> 19:38.907
‎YOU ‎GUY SU-JEONG

182
20:34.963 --> 20:36.173
‎Excuse me, Dr. Jo.

183
20:36.798 --> 20:39.426
‎You said it would be good for the patient

184
20:39.509 --> 20:42.304
‎to hear songs or sounds they like…

185
20:42.387 --> 20:43.930
‎Don't mind her, Dr. Jo.

186
20:44.431 --> 20:46.475
‎Ms. Han can be a busybody.

187
20:47.684 --> 20:48.560
‎Not at all.

188
20:49.061 --> 20:50.270
‎It just slipped my mind.

189
21:11.833 --> 21:13.377
‎Beginning de-airing.

190
21:13.460 --> 21:17.130
‎DE-AIRING: REMOVING AIR ‎FROM BLOOD VESSELS OR THE SURGICAL SITE

191
21:24.846 --> 21:26.223
‎Lowering the head.

192
21:28.100 --> 21:28.934
‎Cut.

193
21:37.025 --> 21:38.527
‎Beginning weaning.

194
21:38.610 --> 21:43.115
‎WEANING: GRADUALLY REDUCING ‎VENTILATOR SUPPORT FOR SELF-BREATHING

195
22:30.328 --> 22:31.163
‎I'm sorry.

196
22:33.248 --> 22:34.749
‎She fell asleep.

197
22:48.471 --> 22:49.347
‎I'm sorry.

198
22:54.186 --> 22:55.228
‎I'm sorry.

199
22:56.438 --> 22:57.314
‎I'm sorry.

200
22:59.357 --> 23:00.901
‎I'm so sorry.

201
23:08.658 --> 23:09.659
‎I'm sorry.

202
23:12.787 --> 23:13.830
‎I'm so sorry.

203
23:17.959 --> 23:19.211
‎This is my fault.

204
23:23.965 --> 23:25.008
‎I'm sorry.

205
24:00.752 --> 24:02.837
‎Hello, Neema.

206
25:24.669 --> 25:26.212
‎-There she is. ‎-Neema!

207
25:28.006 --> 25:30.008
‎-Neema, we missed you so much. ‎-I missed you.

208
25:30.091 --> 25:32.302
‎Are you okay? Yeah? Three, two, one.

209
25:35.013 --> 25:36.598
‎You're so lucky, Neema.

210
25:37.432 --> 25:38.892
‎This is Dr. Gye Su-jeong.

211
25:39.601 --> 25:40.560
‎Thank you so much.

212
25:48.068 --> 25:49.277
‎Thank you for everything.

213
25:50.195 --> 25:51.529
‎Neema is so special.

214
25:51.613 --> 25:52.655
‎Thank you.

215
25:53.615 --> 25:54.657
‎She's the best.

216
26:19.015 --> 26:19.933
‎Hi, Mom.

217
26:41.913 --> 26:42.747
‎Next.

218
26:43.748 --> 26:45.041
‎Neema!

219
26:45.542 --> 26:48.378
‎Hi, welcome!

220
26:49.129 --> 26:50.380
‎-Goodness. ‎-My word.

221
26:50.463 --> 26:51.381
‎So cute.

222
27:15.447 --> 27:16.656
‎Give him 2 mg intravenously.

223
27:16.739 --> 27:17.699
‎Okay.

224
27:23.371 --> 27:26.082
‎What did you do to me?

225
27:30.503 --> 27:31.337
‎Neema…

226
27:32.046 --> 27:33.923
‎Where's Neema?

227
27:36.426 --> 27:38.470
‎How did he know Neema was here?

228
27:40.096 --> 27:41.222
‎He heard us.

229
27:43.016 --> 27:44.225
‎He was awake.

230
27:51.983 --> 27:53.234
‎He woke up…

231
27:55.028 --> 27:56.112
‎during surgery.

232
28:20.011 --> 28:22.972
‎White Wings Medical Corps ‎wants to file a lawsuit.

233
28:23.515 --> 28:25.350
‎Do you have anything to say?

234
28:27.477 --> 28:30.897
‎Can't they just check ‎the CCTV footage, sir?

235
28:30.980 --> 28:32.690
‎There are limits to that.

236
28:32.774 --> 28:34.484
‎And according to hospital rules,

237
28:34.567 --> 28:37.904
‎no one can watch it ‎without the consent of everyone in the OR.

238
28:37.987 --> 28:39.113
‎You know that.

239
28:39.197 --> 28:41.825
‎Ms. Han and I didn't see anything.

240
28:41.908 --> 28:43.660
‎We were focused on the surgical site.

241
28:43.743 --> 28:46.412
‎We have nothing else to contribute.

242
28:49.332 --> 28:50.708
‎Dr. Park Tae-gyeong.

243
28:51.251 --> 28:53.336
‎Don't you have something to tell me?

244
28:58.424 --> 29:00.760
‎Yes, I do. I'll tell you.

245
29:00.844 --> 29:02.846
‎Dr. Park doesn't know anything.

246
29:02.929 --> 29:04.931
‎Then that means you know, Dr. Gye.

247
29:06.099 --> 29:07.642
‎I'm Mr. Kim Seung-hyo's guardian.

248
29:08.685 --> 29:10.770
‎White Wings Medical Corps ‎has no right to sue.

249
29:11.938 --> 29:13.314
‎The surgery went well,

250
29:14.023 --> 29:16.609
‎but unfortunately, ‎he woke up during surgery.

251
29:16.693 --> 29:18.695
‎I'm the anesthesiologist, so that's on me.

252
29:19.237 --> 29:21.114
‎Which means they'll sue me.

253
29:23.283 --> 29:24.742
‎But will he sue his daughter?

254
29:25.493 --> 29:27.287
‎Will the great humanitarian

255
29:27.370 --> 29:29.414
‎Dr. Kim Seung-hyo actually do that?

256
29:36.713 --> 29:38.506
‎Please escort them out.

257
29:48.683 --> 29:51.227
‎The patient was awake ‎early in the surgery,

258
29:51.311 --> 29:54.314
‎so there should have been ‎a change in the BIS score.

259
29:54.397 --> 29:55.398
‎However,

260
29:56.566 --> 29:58.610
‎the monitor was turned off.

261
29:59.694 --> 30:01.779
‎I reviewed the medication log as well.

262
30:02.989 --> 30:05.408
‎I noticed someone checked out

263
30:05.491 --> 30:08.161
‎double the usual dose of flumazenil,

264
30:08.244 --> 30:12.749
‎but it was returned unused.

265
30:17.879 --> 30:19.672
‎Why did you attempt that?

266
30:24.093 --> 30:26.012
‎Why did you want to ‎wake him during surgery?

267
30:30.224 --> 30:31.643
‎Then let me ask you this.

268
30:34.562 --> 30:37.315
‎Why didn't you go through with it?

269
30:53.998 --> 30:57.669
‎How could someone like that be a doctor?

270
30:59.587 --> 31:00.755
‎Humanitarian?

271
31:01.881 --> 31:03.508
‎Just how… Damn it!

272
31:16.729 --> 31:17.897
‎Should I push in the sedative?

273
31:17.981 --> 31:19.232
‎Hold on, let me check.

274
31:19.732 --> 31:20.650
‎Director Bu.

275
31:22.568 --> 31:23.486
‎Director.

276
31:23.569 --> 31:25.154
‎Closing the hospital?

277
31:25.238 --> 31:27.782
‎It hasn't been officially announced yet,

278
31:27.865 --> 31:29.534
‎but it'll be made public soon.

279
31:29.617 --> 31:32.704
‎Is the foundation really selling the site?

280
31:32.787 --> 31:34.288
‎According to the reporter,

281
31:34.372 --> 31:38.042
‎Chairman Gu Bon-pyeong has already met

282
31:38.126 --> 31:39.460
‎with multiple developers.

283
31:39.544 --> 31:42.672
‎That's why the mayor and Kim Chang-su ‎have been quiet these days.

284
31:42.755 --> 31:45.049
‎They're usually the first ‎to roll out the red carpet

285
31:45.133 --> 31:47.760
‎when someone like ‎Kim Seung-hyo has surgery here.

286
31:48.344 --> 31:49.470
‎Guess they've been busy.

287
31:51.681 --> 31:54.267
‎We worked so hard to hang on ‎during COVID-19.

288
31:54.851 --> 31:57.854
‎Without our hospital, ‎this area would've been devastated.

289
31:57.937 --> 32:01.441
‎All our work to prove our worth ‎was pointless.

290
32:01.524 --> 32:04.485
‎They saw patient numbers drop ‎during the medical strike

291
32:04.569 --> 32:07.071
‎and figured they should go ahead and sell.

292
32:07.697 --> 32:08.823
‎Still…

293
32:09.866 --> 32:12.577
‎Shouldn't we at least try something?

294
32:17.165 --> 32:18.583
‎Is no one responding?

295
32:19.375 --> 32:20.460
‎No one, sir.

296
32:20.543 --> 32:23.087
‎Not the mayor, the chairman, ‎or the people around them.

297
32:24.922 --> 32:26.924
‎I'll look into the next Magnolia meeting.

298
33:05.088 --> 33:06.255
‎Dr. Park.

299
33:07.924 --> 33:08.758
‎Why are we here?

300
34:10.653 --> 34:12.321
‎Look where it is.

301
34:13.114 --> 34:14.991
‎She drew him

302
34:15.575 --> 34:16.868
‎right next to where you stood.

303
35:20.014 --> 35:22.183
‎I told my parents.

304
35:30.191 --> 35:31.525
‎MOM: MY DEAR TAE-GYEONG…

305
35:38.658 --> 35:41.619
‎GOD WILL ALWAYS BE WITH YOU. HE IS THERE ‎WHEREVER THERE IS LOVE. WE LOVE YOU.

306
35:51.254 --> 35:52.755
‎They're grateful I held on…

307
35:55.633 --> 35:57.426
‎and grateful that I'm alive.

308
36:05.101 --> 36:06.060
‎So now…

309
36:08.145 --> 36:09.647
‎I'm going to try to be brave.

310
36:35.840 --> 36:37.341
‎Do you think God exists?

311
36:42.138 --> 36:43.472
‎Does it matter?

312
36:45.391 --> 36:47.018
‎Do you believe in God?

313
36:52.273 --> 36:53.357
‎I hate God.

314
36:59.822 --> 37:00.740
‎I think…

315
37:02.199 --> 37:03.409
‎God believes in you.

316
37:07.121 --> 37:08.622
‎That's why He stopped by.

317
37:10.833 --> 37:12.501
‎"I'll deal with this person."

318
37:13.586 --> 37:15.212
‎"So you focus on your job."

319
37:17.798 --> 37:18.716
‎"Go be a doctor

320
37:20.092 --> 37:21.469
‎for a while longer."

321
37:42.907 --> 37:44.617
‎This won't close. I give up.

322
37:48.454 --> 37:49.872
‎It's not all going to fit.

323
37:51.040 --> 37:52.249
‎The problem is…

324
37:53.918 --> 37:55.461
‎we can't leave a single item out.

325
37:55.544 --> 37:56.462
‎I thought ahead

326
37:57.213 --> 37:58.339
‎and bought an extra bag.

327
37:59.382 --> 38:00.299
‎I'll bring it.

328
38:01.217 --> 38:02.510
‎Goodness.

329
38:05.679 --> 38:07.640
‎Are you really not ‎going back to the hospital?

330
38:16.440 --> 38:18.192
‎I don't know if I can.

331
38:19.860 --> 38:21.487
‎I don't know if I can…

332
38:23.656 --> 38:24.657
‎be a doctor again.

333
38:26.951 --> 38:28.327
‎Neema's foster parents

334
38:29.412 --> 38:30.538
‎applied for adoption.

335
38:33.124 --> 38:34.375
‎Neema's really excited.

336
38:35.751 --> 38:38.671
‎You have a family now.

337
38:41.257 --> 38:42.466
‎I'll bring the bag.

338
38:50.099 --> 38:51.016
‎Hey.

339
38:55.438 --> 38:57.440
‎I saw the drawing on the glass.

340
39:09.952 --> 39:11.412
‎I also saw Baraka.

341
39:14.039 --> 39:14.999
‎Asante.

342
40:07.426 --> 40:12.014
‎Oh, my love, magnolia

343
40:14.016 --> 40:15.476
‎We've been here for a while,

344
40:16.101 --> 40:18.145
‎but no one's talking to us.

345
40:19.313 --> 40:24.777
‎Today and tomorrow

346
40:24.860 --> 40:30.783
‎-Thank you, sir. ‎-I will live beautifully forever

347
40:33.577 --> 40:35.955
‎Director Kim Myeong-seop already knew.

348
40:36.664 --> 40:37.790
‎About what, sir?

349
40:38.415 --> 40:41.335
‎He already knew the hospital ‎would end up like this.

350
40:42.461 --> 40:43.462
‎He knew what was coming,

351
40:44.797 --> 40:46.340
‎so he gave me the job without a fight.

352
40:46.423 --> 40:47.424
‎I should've known.

353
40:47.925 --> 40:49.426
‎No wonder he gave it up so easily.

354
40:50.010 --> 40:52.388
‎But we're the only hub hospital ‎in the region.

355
40:53.347 --> 40:55.391
‎There's so much more we can do.

356
40:56.976 --> 41:00.020
‎That song gave us doctors so much courage

357
41:00.104 --> 41:02.189
‎during this difficult time.

358
41:03.440 --> 41:04.900
‎Now, let's see

359
41:05.693 --> 41:07.486
‎which number is next.

360
41:08.279 --> 41:09.280
‎Here we go.

361
41:12.825 --> 41:14.660
‎At this rate, ‎we won't get to say anything.

362
41:15.578 --> 41:19.164
‎We can't persuade them or even grovel ‎if they won't give us an opening.

363
41:19.915 --> 41:21.208
‎Let's see.

364
41:24.962 --> 41:25.796
‎I'll go

365
41:26.880 --> 41:27.840
‎and talk to them.

366
41:28.674 --> 41:30.009
‎Number 19!

367
41:33.220 --> 41:36.390
‎We just listened to ‎an elegant classical song,

368
41:36.473 --> 41:39.101
‎so let's change it up ‎and hear an upbeat song!

369
41:39.727 --> 41:42.563
‎Oh, Number 19 is already on his feet.

370
41:43.480 --> 41:46.567
‎It's the director of ‎Guseo University Seonam Medical Center,

371
41:46.650 --> 41:48.277
‎Bu Seung-gwon.

372
41:51.697 --> 41:54.283
‎I'll do it instead!

373
41:54.366 --> 41:56.160
‎Let's give him a round of applause.

374
42:03.250 --> 42:05.419
‎The chairman is looking forward to this.

375
42:06.003 --> 42:06.837
‎Understand?

376
42:06.920 --> 42:10.466
‎If you want to have a drink ‎and talk to him afterward,

377
42:10.549 --> 42:11.592
‎get your act together.

378
42:12.801 --> 42:13.927
‎Especially you, Director.

379
42:14.637 --> 42:17.681
‎You need to step up ‎to make up for that major mistake.

380
42:18.474 --> 42:20.309
‎If you can't sing, then at least dance.

381
42:33.822 --> 42:34.657
‎Damn it.

382
42:35.240 --> 42:36.700
‎Dr. Do, where are you going?

383
42:36.784 --> 42:37.701
‎What will you do?

384
42:46.543 --> 42:49.213
‎1-4-2-4-6.

385
42:51.507 --> 42:52.883
‎"BINGO" ‎SONG BY: TURTLES

386
42:55.094 --> 42:56.512
‎Ladies and gentlemen

387
42:57.012 --> 42:58.639
‎Yes, I'm back again

388
42:58.722 --> 43:01.100
‎Yes, I'm back again ‎I feel so good

389
43:01.183 --> 43:02.226
‎Director.

390
43:02.309 --> 43:05.813
‎-Let me sing a song first ‎-One, two, three, four

391
43:05.896 --> 43:08.357
‎Feeling so happy I'm about to burst…

392
43:09.024 --> 43:10.734
‎Wait, you can't go.

393
43:12.986 --> 43:16.323
‎If I start again on pure grit

394
43:16.407 --> 43:19.910
‎I'll accomplish everything I desire

395
43:19.993 --> 43:23.414
‎I love the land I'm living in right now

396
43:26.458 --> 43:27.459
‎Oh, damn it.

397
44:39.615 --> 44:43.410
‎After months of closure rumors, ‎Guseo University Seonam Medical Center

398
44:43.494 --> 44:44.828
‎will shut down in September.

399
44:45.329 --> 44:48.332
‎As a branch of ‎the long-standing GUMC system,

400
44:48.415 --> 44:51.793
‎it served as a hub hospital ‎in the greater Seoul area.

401
44:51.877 --> 44:53.545
‎Let's go to our reporter on the scene.

402
44:53.629 --> 44:55.464
‎END THE DOCTORS' STRIKE. ‎WE CONDEMN DOUBLE STANDARDS.

403
44:55.547 --> 44:58.425
‎-Ms. Han, more to the right. ‎-‎Guseo Foundation announced

404
44:58.509 --> 45:01.553
‎-the closure of GUMC's Seonam branch. ‎-Ms. Han.

405
45:01.637 --> 45:03.514
‎In its press release, ‎it cited mounting losses,

406
45:03.597 --> 45:05.474
‎system modernization costs,

407
45:05.557 --> 45:08.101
‎and staff shortages ‎as the reasons for the closure.

408
45:08.185 --> 45:10.312
‎Some believe that ‎the ongoing intern resident strike

409
45:10.395 --> 45:12.356
‎and medical students' leaves of absence

410
45:12.439 --> 45:15.901
‎likely accelerated the decision ‎to shut down the hospital.

411
45:16.527 --> 45:17.444
‎This just in.

412
45:17.528 --> 45:18.946
‎Dr. Kim Seung-hyo,

413
45:19.029 --> 45:22.241
‎a renowned humanitarian ‎and head of the White Wings Medical Corps,

414
45:22.324 --> 45:24.868
‎is facing a wave of new allegations ‎from more victims

415
45:24.952 --> 45:27.704
‎after a claim surfaced ‎that he sexually abused a minor.

416
45:27.788 --> 45:29.706
‎As victims continue to report

417
45:29.790 --> 45:32.417
‎being sexually abused ‎under the guise of "playing doctor,"

418
45:32.501 --> 45:35.504
‎a photo album allegedly belonging to ‎Dr. Kim Seung-hyo was made public,

419
45:35.587 --> 45:37.589
‎causing widespread outrage.

420
45:37.673 --> 45:39.132
‎Reporter Jung Ga-ram has more.

421
45:39.216 --> 45:42.010
‎The album is filled ‎with photos of countless children.

422
45:42.094 --> 45:44.429
‎There are nothing but photos of children.

423
45:44.513 --> 45:48.183
‎This photo album, ‎obtained from an anonymous source,

424
45:48.267 --> 45:49.977
‎belongs to Dr. Kim Seung-hyo.

425
45:50.060 --> 45:53.272
‎Most of the children in the photos ‎have been identified as those

426
45:53.355 --> 45:56.108
‎from a child refugee camp ‎run by the White Wings Medical Corps.

427
45:56.608 --> 45:59.027
‎The organization claims ‎they were just health records…

428
46:04.408 --> 46:06.118
‎SYSTEM SHUTTING DOWN

429
46:13.959 --> 46:16.003
‎It's nice to eat together again ‎after so long.

430
46:17.879 --> 46:19.256
‎I'll come eat more often.

431
46:19.798 --> 46:22.134
‎Let's live in hell together

432
46:23.010 --> 46:24.011
‎for a long time,

433
46:24.678 --> 46:25.554
‎Dad.

434
46:50.621 --> 46:51.913
‎A farewell party?

435
46:52.748 --> 46:54.583
‎You didn't have to do this.

436
46:54.666 --> 46:56.043
‎Don't worry about it.

437
46:56.710 --> 46:58.754
‎We just felt like drinking.

438
46:58.837 --> 47:01.256
‎So we called Gye Su-jeong here too.

439
47:01.340 --> 47:02.299
‎Tell me.

440
47:02.799 --> 47:06.470
‎Whenever we told you to stay away, ‎you always showed up.

441
47:07.220 --> 47:09.806
‎But when we were desperate for help ‎and begged you to come,

442
47:09.890 --> 47:10.891
‎you didn't.

443
47:11.516 --> 47:12.643
‎Seriously, why?

444
47:12.726 --> 47:14.728
‎PTO, day off, half-day off…

445
47:15.646 --> 47:17.397
‎Don't I get something like that?

446
47:18.482 --> 47:19.566
‎Or maybe disciplinary action?

447
47:19.650 --> 47:21.401
‎Of course not. You're a temp.

448
47:22.402 --> 47:23.612
‎And you.

449
47:23.695 --> 47:25.155
‎Don't ghost us just because

450
47:25.238 --> 47:27.532
‎your surgery rotation is over ‎and you're off to another hospital.

451
47:27.616 --> 47:29.701
‎Of course not. I couldn't possibly…

452
47:29.785 --> 47:31.078
‎I'd never do that.

453
47:34.122 --> 47:35.540
‎-Director… ‎-Hey.

454
47:35.624 --> 47:37.876
‎You should drink tonight, Director.

455
47:37.959 --> 47:40.212
‎Order anything you want here. It's on me.

456
47:40.295 --> 47:42.547
‎No, I'd like to pay tonight.

457
47:42.631 --> 47:43.840
‎I'm paying.

458
47:44.925 --> 47:46.635
‎After all, Dr. Park is graduating…

459
47:47.719 --> 47:49.262
‎and so am I.

460
47:53.725 --> 47:55.435
‎Let's drink.

461
47:57.396 --> 48:00.148
‎It's just us for the first time, right?

462
48:00.232 --> 48:01.942
‎All right, here we go.

463
48:02.025 --> 48:04.027
‎-Cheers! ‎-Cheers!

464
48:04.111 --> 48:05.320
‎Cheers.

465
48:07.280 --> 48:09.074
‎Director Bu decided to retire.

466
48:09.616 --> 48:11.284
‎Once the closure became official,

467
48:11.368 --> 48:14.329
‎he lost the motivation ‎and the strength to keep going.

468
48:15.414 --> 48:18.041
‎His retirement ceremony is ‎five days from now.

469
48:19.042 --> 48:21.002
‎We're going to give him a grand send-off.

470
48:22.546 --> 48:23.505
‎It looks like we,

471
48:24.506 --> 48:26.550
‎the three surgery suck-ups,

472
48:27.509 --> 48:28.510
‎are also graduating.

473
48:30.721 --> 48:33.140
‎I never thought ‎they'd actually close it down.

474
48:33.765 --> 48:38.186
‎The mayor will probably rezone the land ‎for commercial use soon.

475
48:38.270 --> 48:41.732
‎He'll get rid of the hospital ‎and do whatever turns a profit.

476
48:41.815 --> 48:45.277
‎Still, there's no better ‎hub hospital in the area.

477
48:46.695 --> 48:50.198
‎Hey, we tried really hard.

478
48:51.199 --> 48:52.534
‎You have no idea, do you, Gye?

479
48:53.410 --> 48:54.786
‎You probably don't.

480
48:55.370 --> 48:57.998
‎You know, in our own way,

481
48:59.416 --> 49:00.959
‎we tried really hard

482
49:01.501 --> 49:02.961
‎to make things work…

483
49:04.546 --> 49:07.048
‎I'm sorry for causing so much trouble.

484
49:08.091 --> 49:09.342
‎Park Tae-gyeong!

485
49:10.010 --> 49:12.596
‎You little troublemaker. You…

486
49:13.346 --> 49:17.434
‎I'm never going to forget you.

487
49:18.560 --> 49:19.394
‎Is he okay?

488
49:21.980 --> 49:23.523
‎The director drank a lot.

489
49:26.985 --> 49:27.944
‎Director Bu.

490
49:37.496 --> 49:40.040
‎I'll go buy some hangover remedies.

491
49:41.124 --> 49:42.125
‎Dr. Park Tae-gyeong.

492
49:44.211 --> 49:45.378
‎Thank you for everything.

493
49:51.384 --> 49:52.302
‎Not at all, sir.

494
49:53.386 --> 49:56.348
‎I'm sorry I couldn't do better.

495
49:59.434 --> 50:01.186
‎No, I'm sorry.

496
50:02.646 --> 50:04.397
‎I couldn't do better…

497
50:06.691 --> 50:09.903
‎so I made it hard for everyone.

498
50:12.239 --> 50:13.698
‎I couldn't do better, so…

499
50:16.910 --> 50:19.371
‎Goodness, Director. Please don't.

500
50:20.455 --> 50:22.082
‎Don't say that, sir.

501
50:22.833 --> 50:24.167
‎All right then.

502
50:24.251 --> 50:27.337
‎Since you're on your feet, ‎how about giving Dr. Park

503
50:28.004 --> 50:29.172
‎some words of wisdom?

504
50:32.551 --> 50:33.927
‎I want to sing.

505
50:35.053 --> 50:35.887
‎What?

506
50:35.971 --> 50:39.266
‎Instead of words of wisdom or a speech…

507
50:41.768 --> 50:42.894
‎I want to sing.

508
50:43.478 --> 50:44.396
‎Here?

509
50:55.824 --> 51:00.245
‎The frozen shadow

510
51:01.246 --> 51:05.667
‎Of the moon

511
51:07.002 --> 51:12.299
‎Rests upon

512
51:12.382 --> 51:15.176
‎The waves

513
51:16.344 --> 51:20.390
‎In the cold winter

514
51:21.600 --> 51:26.104
‎A small island

515
51:27.105 --> 51:30.734
‎Stands alone

516
51:30.817 --> 51:34.946
‎Against the raging sea

517
51:36.865 --> 51:40.911
‎Remember

518
51:42.037 --> 51:45.040
‎-The keeper… ‎-Hyeon-a, say hi to Dad.

519
51:45.123 --> 51:47.459
‎-‎Dad! ‎-Hyeon-a!

520
51:47.959 --> 51:49.294
‎What are you doing, Dad?

521
51:49.377 --> 51:50.587
‎I'm working, of course.

522
51:50.670 --> 51:52.839
‎…of that lighthouse

523
52:07.520 --> 52:10.857
‎Are you done being a doctor?

524
52:11.441 --> 52:12.943
‎I'd like to ask you the same thing.

525
52:14.569 --> 52:15.570
‎Gye Su-jeong.

526
52:16.529 --> 52:18.573
‎Are you done being a doctor?

527
52:23.328 --> 52:24.454
‎Are you really retiring?

528
52:27.123 --> 52:27.958
‎Yes.

529
52:29.376 --> 52:30.210
‎I thought

530
52:31.378 --> 52:33.254
‎I was a lighthouse keeper.

531
52:35.090 --> 52:36.216
‎But it turns out…

532
52:37.425 --> 52:39.844
‎I was a ship lost at sea.

533
52:46.685 --> 52:49.145
‎Whether it's lost or sinking,

534
52:50.271 --> 52:51.106
‎a ship…

535
52:52.565 --> 52:53.817
‎needs a captain.

536
52:55.735 --> 52:56.611
‎So?

537
52:58.780 --> 53:00.699
‎Are you telling me to go down with it?

538
53:01.616 --> 53:02.492
‎Even so,

539
53:03.243 --> 53:05.412
‎a captain gets everyone ‎safely back to land.

540
53:06.871 --> 53:07.706
‎I believe

541
53:08.707 --> 53:10.417
‎that's your role, Director.

542
53:23.221 --> 53:26.808
‎By the way, that's the most expensive one.

543
53:59.215 --> 54:00.759
‎Come on! Let's go to work!

544
54:04.512 --> 54:06.389
‎Right, let's go to work.

545
54:07.015 --> 54:10.518
‎I need to work ‎if we want to replace this beat-up car.

546
54:10.602 --> 54:13.730
‎With all those repairs, ‎it's basically a new car.

547
54:16.066 --> 54:18.151
‎It's been a while,

548
54:18.234 --> 54:19.986
‎so I'll jog to the hospital today.

549
54:20.070 --> 54:23.531
‎Get over here this instant. ‎You've never jogged in your life.

550
54:23.615 --> 54:26.326
‎We're in this together, all the way.

551
54:26.409 --> 54:27.911
‎-Sure, we're one. ‎-Come on.

552
54:30.288 --> 54:31.247
‎Get in.

553
54:31.331 --> 54:32.457
‎Let's get going.

554
54:32.540 --> 54:35.668
‎For the first time ‎since the agency opened,

555
54:35.752 --> 54:37.921
‎the whole team is going to work together!

556
54:38.004 --> 54:39.005
‎Seatbelt!

557
54:40.131 --> 54:41.049
‎Seatbelt.

558
54:43.343 --> 54:44.969
‎Let's go!

559
54:45.053 --> 54:46.763
‎-Hang on tight. ‎-We got this!

560
55:07.784 --> 55:09.994
‎DIRECTOR BU SEUNG-GWON RETIREMENT CEREMONY

561
55:15.834 --> 55:18.461
‎HAVE YOU CONSIDERED WORKING OVERSEAS? ‎"I'M GIVING IT SERIOUS THOUGHT"

562
55:26.970 --> 55:29.013
‎K-MEDICINE ‎EVERYTHING ABOUT WORKING ABROAD

563
55:29.806 --> 55:32.100
‎HOSTED BY: ‎SEONAM MEDICAL ASSOCIATION, MAGNOLIA

564
55:37.856 --> 55:39.357
‎I knew you'd come.

565
55:39.440 --> 55:40.483
‎You scared me.

566
55:47.782 --> 55:49.117
‎Clocking out or quitting?

567
55:51.161 --> 55:52.120
‎The latter.

568
55:52.203 --> 55:53.913
‎So this is it.

569
55:55.081 --> 55:58.251
‎In that case, ‎we should have one last work dinner,

570
55:58.334 --> 55:59.544
‎but I'm on call today.

571
56:01.254 --> 56:02.797
‎Can't you quit on Wednesday?

572
56:02.881 --> 56:04.507
‎I can leave work on time that day.

573
56:04.591 --> 56:05.717
‎Let's say our goodbyes here.

574
56:06.593 --> 56:08.887
‎In the place that most resembles you.

575
56:13.016 --> 56:15.018
‎Look at you, getting sentimental.

576
56:15.977 --> 56:17.061
‎Guess I've rubbed off on you.

577
56:18.479 --> 56:21.107
‎I'll save you as "Fun Won-jin" ‎on my phone now.

578
56:21.733 --> 56:23.401
‎You're going to the main hospital, right?

579
56:23.484 --> 56:25.361
‎-No. ‎-You're not?

580
56:26.154 --> 56:27.864
‎I'm looking into regional medical centers.

581
56:27.947 --> 56:31.451
‎Remote places that need ‎genius doctors like me.

582
56:33.703 --> 56:34.996
‎I know that look.

583
56:35.079 --> 56:37.749
‎It means "Kim Seong-jin is so amazing." ‎I know, I've seen it a lot.

584
56:37.832 --> 56:40.418
‎No, it means "This is disturbing."

585
56:40.960 --> 56:43.004
‎"He'll call and text me even more."

586
56:43.087 --> 56:44.547
‎"I need to block him."

587
56:45.215 --> 56:48.259
‎No way, I'm going to be super busy ‎and super popular there.

588
56:48.343 --> 56:50.053
‎The elderly folks will love me.

589
56:50.136 --> 56:52.180
‎And I'll become besties with ‎next-generation farmers.

590
56:52.263 --> 56:53.640
‎Sure, go ahead.

591
57:01.356 --> 57:03.566
‎Firefighters and EMTs say

592
57:04.150 --> 57:08.238
‎there's a good doctor working in the ER ‎at Guseo University Seonam Medical Center.

593
57:09.572 --> 57:11.950
‎Too bad that doctor won't be here anymore.

594
57:15.036 --> 57:16.913
‎I'm sure all the patients you've saved

595
57:17.789 --> 57:18.998
‎are grateful to you.

596
57:20.208 --> 57:23.002
‎Good work, Dr. Kim Seong-jin.

597
57:28.091 --> 57:29.050
‎Well…

598
57:30.677 --> 57:32.595
‎No matter what anyone says,

599
57:33.638 --> 57:35.723
‎whether you're Kim Won-jin or Jo Won-jin,

600
57:36.599 --> 57:37.976
‎you'll always be

601
57:39.185 --> 57:40.436
‎Fun Won-jin to me.

602
57:45.858 --> 57:46.943
‎Want to come?

603
57:51.906 --> 57:53.199
‎Once I decide where to go,

604
57:53.950 --> 57:55.451
‎will you come with me?

605
58:04.419 --> 58:05.878
‎Go with you where?

606
58:05.962 --> 58:07.922
‎-You need to go over there. ‎-Okay.

607
58:08.506 --> 58:11.217
‎I'm creating a group chat ‎with Dr. Gye and Dr. Park.

608
58:11.301 --> 58:14.178
‎It'll be "Kim Seong-jin and GyeParkJo." ‎Pretty cool, right?

609
58:14.262 --> 58:16.222
‎I'll invite you, ‎so promise you won't leave it!

610
58:24.814 --> 58:26.899
‎All that talk about quitting, ‎and you went there?

611
58:28.067 --> 58:29.694
‎Yes, it turned out that way.

612
58:29.777 --> 58:31.946
‎Do you think I wanted to take him in?

613
58:34.115 --> 58:36.784
‎I had no choice but to accept you ‎because it was fate, Dr. Park.

614
58:36.868 --> 58:39.370
‎That's taking it too far, sir.

615
58:39.454 --> 58:41.289
‎Dr. Kim going on rounds with the director?

616
58:41.873 --> 58:43.041
‎We really are closing down.

617
58:43.124 --> 58:47.086
‎He opened the ER today, ‎so I came to thank him.

618
58:48.046 --> 58:49.130
‎Here he comes.

619
58:50.548 --> 58:51.633
‎The doors are opening.

620
59:09.817 --> 59:13.237
‎Director Bu Seung-gwon ‎will now begin rounds.

621
59:24.874 --> 59:25.708
‎Dr. Jo.

622
59:25.792 --> 59:26.834
‎Ms. Jang.

623
59:27.460 --> 59:29.128
‎Did you come to work with Dr. Gye?

624
59:29.962 --> 59:32.799
‎I need to keep an eye on Su-jeong today.

625
59:32.882 --> 59:33.716
‎I see.

626
59:36.094 --> 59:38.388
‎I heard you're going back to Lagota.

627
59:42.433 --> 59:44.602
‎I heard you quit.

628
59:45.812 --> 59:46.646
‎Yes.

629
59:48.398 --> 59:50.692
‎Nice to meet you, Dr. Jo Won-jin.

630
59:50.775 --> 59:51.651
‎Hello.

631
59:52.735 --> 59:55.780
‎I'm Jang Hui-suk, head of the country's ‎first-ever locum tenens agency.

632
59:56.698 --> 59:59.659
‎You're now at the top of ‎our agency's recruitment list.

633
59:59.742 --> 01:00:03.538
‎Please think about it while I'm in Lagota.

634
01:00:03.621 --> 01:00:05.957
‎Better yet, why don't you come with me?

635
01:00:06.040 --> 01:00:07.375
‎You're funny.

636
01:00:08.459 --> 01:00:09.961
‎-Think about it, okay? ‎-I will.

637
01:00:25.393 --> 01:00:26.394
‎You liar.

638
01:00:26.936 --> 01:00:28.104
‎Fringe tree, my foot.

639
01:00:35.611 --> 01:00:37.488
‎I guess the secret's out

640
01:00:38.072 --> 01:00:40.867
‎that I'm Ms. Jang's eyes and ears.

641
01:00:53.045 --> 01:00:54.213
‎This place

642
01:00:55.548 --> 01:00:56.966
‎is wonderful.

643
01:00:57.550 --> 01:01:00.428
‎What brings you here? ‎We could've met in your office.

644
01:01:01.179 --> 01:01:05.016
‎I want to formally bring Dr. Gye on ‎as a full-time doctor.

645
01:01:06.768 --> 01:01:08.227
‎With all due respect,

646
01:01:08.311 --> 01:01:12.273
‎I can't send Dr. Gye to a hospital ‎that will be closing down soon.

647
01:01:12.356 --> 01:01:13.649
‎When it closes,

648
01:01:14.150 --> 01:01:17.195
‎I'll personally see to it ‎she gets a spot in the main hospital.

649
01:01:19.781 --> 01:01:21.866
‎Do we have a deal?

650
01:01:22.617 --> 01:01:23.493
‎And her salary?

651
01:01:24.869 --> 01:01:26.078
‎Subject to negotiation?

652
01:01:30.792 --> 01:01:31.626
‎Sounds good.

653
01:01:36.422 --> 01:01:39.634
‎But Dr. Gye gets the final call.

654
01:01:46.682 --> 01:01:48.392
‎Have you decided?

655
01:01:54.732 --> 01:01:58.110
‎GYE SU-JEONG

656
01:02:46.868 --> 01:02:47.702
‎Yes?

657
01:02:48.452 --> 01:02:49.537
‎I'm on my way.

658
01:02:49.620 --> 01:02:51.622
‎There's an emergency. Come on, intern!

659
01:02:51.706 --> 01:02:52.540
‎Yes, sir!

660
01:03:04.093 --> 01:03:05.011
‎Right.

661
01:03:05.553 --> 01:03:06.596
‎This is who you are.

662
01:03:08.139 --> 01:03:09.974
‎Go on, Gye Su-jeong.

663
01:03:14.979 --> 01:03:16.314
‎I'll be going then.

664
01:03:44.383 --> 01:03:46.636
‎This is the story of a lone wolf.

665
01:03:48.304 --> 01:03:51.098
‎She belongs to no group ‎and despises authority.

666
01:03:52.516 --> 01:03:54.310
‎Her only weapons are her medical license

667
01:03:54.393 --> 01:03:57.688
‎and the surgical skills ‎she has honed from the bottom up.

668
01:03:59.273 --> 01:04:00.650
‎Doctor X.

669
01:04:01.609 --> 01:04:02.860
‎Also known as…

670
01:04:03.945 --> 01:04:06.614
‎Gye Su-jeong, the surgeon.

671
01:04:07.239 --> 01:04:10.159
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

672
01:04:10.242 --> 01:04:13.663
‎SPECIAL THANKS TO KIM WON-HAE AND ‎JANG SEUNG-JO FOR THEIR GUEST APPEARANCES

673
01:04:49.281 --> 01:04:52.201
‎DOCTOR X: MAFIA IN WHITE

674
01:04:52.284 --> 01:04:53.285
‎Start.

675
01:04:53.369 --> 01:04:56.789
‎"SONG OF HA HA HA"

676
01:05:02.420 --> 01:05:08.175
‎On days when everything brings you down

677
01:05:08.259 --> 01:05:11.679
‎Try singing this song

678
01:05:12.888 --> 01:05:17.852
‎You still have a flame in your heart

679
01:05:17.935 --> 01:05:21.689
‎So don't give up and keep fighting

680
01:05:21.772 --> 01:05:26.569
‎Hey, hey, hey, hey

681
01:05:27.403 --> 01:05:30.197
‎La-la-la-la, let your regrets

682
01:05:30.281 --> 01:05:33.451
‎Fly up to the sky

683
01:05:33.534 --> 01:05:36.662
‎La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la, my friend

684
01:05:36.746 --> 01:05:40.041
‎Go make a fresh start

685
01:05:40.124 --> 01:05:42.960
‎A life of groveling

686
01:05:43.044 --> 01:05:45.171
‎Was never meant for you

687
01:05:46.255 --> 01:05:49.300
‎So hold your head high, my friend

688
01:05:49.383 --> 01:05:52.428
‎This is just the beginning

689
01:05:52.511 --> 01:05:55.556
‎La-la-la-la, bring your heart

690
01:05:55.639 --> 01:05:58.434
‎Into full bloom

691
01:05:58.517 --> 01:06:01.687
‎La-la-la-la-la-la-la-la, my friend

692
01:06:01.771 --> 01:06:05.024
‎Laugh to your heart's content

693
01:06:05.107 --> 01:06:08.235
‎Ha, ha-ha, ha-ha

694
01:06:08.319 --> 01:06:11.280
‎Ha, ha-ha, ha-ha

695
01:06:11.363 --> 01:06:14.450
‎Ha, ha-ha, ha-ha

696
01:06:14.533 --> 01:06:17.203
‎Ha, ha-ha, ha-ha

697
01:06:37.014 --> 01:06:42.019
‎Subtitle translation by: Jenny Kim
